{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120495","id":3904754920,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ovdTo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120495.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120495/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120495/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120495/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7067e11b7b9b240e7dca1324f24cd5987d371a8a","number":120495,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GraphEdit: Fix dragged connection preview thicker than settled connections","user":{"login":"reforia","id":11989463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTg5NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11989463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia","html_url":"https://github.com/reforia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The dragged connection line is created with `use_parent_material(true)`, so it ignores the per-line `ShaderMaterial` that `_update_top_connection_layer()` assigns it and renders against the parent material instead. The connection shader's rim/AA is then sized for the wrong width, so the drag preview draws visibly thicker than established connections.\n\nEstablished connection lines are created at runtime in `connect_node()` and keep their own material — only the constructor-built `dragged_connection_line` was swept into the recent change making internal children use their parent's material. Dropping `use_parent_material` on it restores its own correctly-configured material, matching connections.\n\nBefore/After screenshots to follow.\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-20T18:49:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-20T21:42:17Z","closed_at":"2026-06-20T18:57:54Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"80c8627e38d0b8bb09835e47554cb1c27a652b45","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"reforia:fix-graphedit-dragged-connection-material","ref":"fix-graphedit-dragged-connection-material","repo":{"id":1133409416,"node_id":"R_kgDOQ450iA","name":"godot","full_name":"reforia/godot","owner":{"login":"reforia","id":11989463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTg5NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11989463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia","html_url":"https://github.com/reforia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reforia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.